    "description": "- Spearheaded redesign of the test order form's PDF representation, improving layouts, and seamlessly integrating AWS Lambda functions to enhance accessibility and workflows across company systems. \n- Collaborated with a project lead to develop the \"Strata Select\" reporting system, implementing a dynamic versioning mechanism within the AWS Lambda function and HTML using Jinja code.\n- Enabled the generation of frequent and backward-compatible versions, enhancing flexibility for internal teams and client satisfaction.\n- Implemented a novel exception handling method for the customer portal system, designing a validation function to raise a custom exception class for failed Strata order request field validations.\n- Enhanced back-end logging by addressing database exceptions, facilitating simplified error tracking and handling in an event-driven architecture. \n- Augmented security and readability by adding functionality to sanitize exceptions for front-end use.\n- Architected a system in Strata's portal to selectively suppress information, empowering clinical partners with configurable options to hide specific reports from physicians.\n- Collaborated within a team environment to address critical features and bugs, resolving issues that hindered customer operations and ensuring seamless service delivery and customer satisfaction.\n- Participated in stakeholder meetings to build project requirements, validating progress and ensuring alignment between project scope and objectives to guarantee efficient project delivery.\n- Participated in code reviews, ensuring compliance with coding standards and improving code quality.\n- Created and maintained technical documentation for software development processes and codebases.",
